NOTICE

TRACE — Environmental Information Discovery Platform is a knowledge-management and information-discovery prototype. It is not an official replacement for the Environmental Management Authority website, the Institute of Marine Affairs Library, another issuing institution's repository, or any formal access/regulatory process.

TRACE indexes EMA records and selected related national, regional, international, media, statistical, dataset and spatial sources for discovery. Source attribution and access pathways should be retained. IMA-held records must retain Institute of Marine Affairs attribution and, where no public file is available, direct users to the IMA Library/request pathway.

Descriptions, classifications, search expansion, related-record suggestions, media groupings and spatial associations are informational aids only. Official copies, legal effect, regulatory requirements, access decisions and document availability should be confirmed through the original authoritative source and applicable EMA process.

Linked official and third-party documents are not redistributed or relicensed by this repository unless explicitly included with permission or applicable reuse terms.
